<main>
  <section class="block" id="about">
    <div class="wrap about">
      <h2>About me</h2>
      <div class="copy">
        <p>I've spent over a year in international contact centres, helping European Uber Eats customers at Teleperformance and U.S. Optimum customers at Intelcia. I handled orders, refunds, billing and account problems by phone, email and chat, and was promoted to Team Leader.</p>
        <p>Today I also work as a freelance English–Arabic interpreter, which has made me even more careful about saying things clearly, neutrally and accurately. I'm studying Computer Science at the Arab Open University, so I'm comfortable learning new tools and systems quickly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="approach">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>How I handle a case</h2>
        <p>Every customer issue goes through the same five steps, whether it's a quick question or an angry complaint.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="process">
        <li><h3>Listen</h3><p>Let the customer explain fully, confirm what they need, and acknowledge how they feel.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Investigate</h3><p>Check the order, account and history, and bring in other teams when the fix sits with them.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Resolve</h3><p>Give a clear solution in plain language and take ownership instead of passing the customer on.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Follow up</h3><p>Check back to make sure the problem is actually solved, not just the ticket closed.</p></li>
        <li><h3>Record</h3><p>Log the interaction, cause and outcome so recurring problems show up and can be fixed.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <p>International accounts with high volume and strict service-level and quality targets.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs">
        <article class="job">
          <div class="when"><b>Oct 2024 – Jan 2026</b>Cairo, Egypt</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Customer Service Representative <span class="promo">Promoted to Team Leader</span></h3>
            <p class="org">Teleperformance, Uber Eats Europe account</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Handled order, delivery, refund and account cases for European customers in written English at high daily volume, meeting service-level and quality targets.</li>
              <li>Investigated problems end to end and coordinated with delivery partners and internal teams to resolve them within SLA.</li>
              <li>Documented every interaction, complaint and resolution accurately so cases could be tracked and followed up.</li>
              <li>As Team Leader, coached agents, monitored queue and SLA performance, took over escalated cases and trained new hires.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="job">
          <div class="when"><b>Nov 2025 – Jan 2026</b>Cairo, Egypt</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Retention and Sales Representative</h3>
            <p class="org">Intelcia, Optimum U.S. account</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Answered inbound calls and back-office cases from U.S. customers on service, billing and account issues, resolving most on first contact.</li>
              <li>Calmly handled dissatisfied customers asking to cancel, found the real reason behind the complaint, and kept them with suitable plan and pricing options.</li>
              <li>Explained bills and service changes in plain language while following call-quality and compliance guidelines.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="job">
          <div class="when"><b>Feb 2026 – Present</b>Remote</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Freelance English–Arabic Interpreter</h3>
            <p class="org">Lingotec</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Provide consecutive interpreting in live client sessions, communicating both sides accurately, neutrally and professionally.</li>
              <li>Manage my own schedule across time zones, research specialised terminology and keep client information confidential.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block" id="skills">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>What I bring</h2>
        <p>The skills a customer care team relies on every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skills">
        <div>
          <h3>Communication</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Phone, email and chat support</li>
            <li>Clear written and spoken English</li>
            <li>Active listening and empathy</li>
